spec:
  id: reflection_model
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: highest
  module: Cognition
  compiler_stage: Reflective Cognition
  description: >
purpose[5]: Learn,improve,generalize,preserve,engineering experience.
philosophy[8]: Every decision,teaches something.,Every mistake,has value.,Reflection converts,experience into knowledge.,Expertise is accumulated,reflection.
pipeline[13]: Outcome,→,Compare Expectation,→,Detect Differences,→,Root Cause Analysis,→,Lesson Extraction,→,Generalization,→,Memory Update
inputs[8]: Engineering Decision,Implementation,Validation Results,Production Metrics,Benchmarks,Incidents,User Feedback,Code Reviews
outputs[6]: Lesson,Best Practice,Anti Pattern,Updated Memory,Engineering Guideline,Knowledge Atom
types[7]: Success Reflection,Failure Reflection,Performance Reflection,Security Reflection,Architecture Reflection,Process Reflection,Team Reflection
questions[8]: What happened?,Why did it happen?,What assumptions failed?,What assumptions held?,What surprised us?,What would we change?,What should be reused?,What should be avoided?
analysis[6]: Compare Prediction,Compare Outcome,Compare Alternatives,Measure Impact,Measure Cost,Measure Risk
lessons[6]: Best Practice,Anti Pattern,Heuristic,Rule,Guideline,Design Principle
generalization[5]: Local,Project,Domain,Cross Domain,Universal
memory[5]: Reinforce,Correct,Merge,Replace,Archive
biases[5]: Hindsight Bias,Confirmation Bias,Outcome Bias,Survivorship Bias,Anchoring Bias
mitigation[5]: Evidence Review,Independent Analysis,Alternative Explanations,Counterfactual Thinking,Peer Review
failure[5]: Root Cause,Trigger,Propagation,Recovery,Prevention
success[3]: Every engineering activity,improves future engineering,through structured reflection.
heuristics[5]: Prefer Simplicity,Measure Before Optimizing,Fail Fast,Validate Assumptions,Document Decisions
integration[4]: Update Semantic Memory,Update Episodic Memory,Update Procedural Memory,Reinforce Mental Models
ekr:
  description: Every Engineering Knowledge Record
  stores[5]: Expected Outcome,Actual Outcome,Reflection,Lessons Learned,Memory Updates
validation[8]: Every reflection,references evidence.,Every lesson,is actionable.,Every improvement,is justified.,Every reflection,updates engineering knowledge.
examples:
  Example_01:
    Expected: Query Faster
    Actual: 45% Faster
    Lesson[2]: Composite Index,Works Under This Workload
  Example_02:
    Expected: Better Scalability
    Actual: Operational Complexity Increased
    Lesson[2]: Microservices,Were Premature
  Example_03:
    Expected: Memory Reduction
    Actual: Cache Thrashing
    Lesson[2]: Working Set,Exceeded Cache Capacity
  Example_04:
    Expected: Faster Deployment
    Actual: Increased Rollbacks
    Lesson[2]: Deployment Speed,Requires Better Validation
metrics[6]: Lessons Generated,Memory Updates,Reflection Depth,Improvement Rate,Repeated Mistakes,Prevented Failures
guarantees[5]: Continuous Learning,Explicit Lessons,Memory Evolution,Engineering Improvement,Explainable Experience
future:
  autonomous_reflection: true
  lesson_graphs: true
  reflective_planning: true
  cross_project_learning: true
  lifelong_engineering_growth: true
